			<div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
				<div class="card p-6">
					<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Hiking and trail navigation</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body leading-6">
						Orient a paper map before you set off, take a back bearing to retrace your route, and
